/-
# The Schur centre on the critical observation chart

Bundles three facts about the marked observation chart ring of the critical horizon: the chart tower
into the source field is injective, module-finite and Noetherian, with the observation field as
fraction field (`TowerFinite`); the centre of the Schur place on the chart is a nonzero prime of
height one (`CentreHeight`); and the local ring at that centre is a discrete valuation ring with the
observation field as fraction field, mapping into the observation Schur valuation ring (`LocalRing`).
-/

